\begin{align*}
(2x + 5)^2 &= (2(3) + 5)^2 \\
&= (6 + 5)^2 \\
&= 11^2 \\
&= \boxed{121}
\end{align*}

Therefore, when $x = 3$, the value of $(2x + 5)^2$ is 121.

